flowchart LR
  S[Source Connector] --> R[Raw Record + Rights]
  R --> V[Validate]
  V --> N[Normalize]
  N --> E[Resolve Venue/Organizer]
  E --> G[Geocode]
  G --> C[Classify]
  C --> D[Dedupe Candidates]
  D -->|high confidence| M[Canonical Upsert]
  D -->|medium| Q[Admin Dedupe Queue]
  Q --> M
  M --> T[Translation/Moderation]
  T --> P[Published Event/Occurrence]
  P --> F[Feed/Search/Map]
